{"path":"io/basic_filebuf/is_open","title":"std::basic_filebuf<CharT,Traits>::is_open","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::basic_filebuf&lt;CharT,Traits&gt;::</span>is_open","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/io/basic_filebuf/is_open","section":"io","kind":"page","summary":"Returns true if the most recent call to open() succeeded and there has been no call to close() since then.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> is_open<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> if the most recent call to <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_filebuf/open\">open()</a></span> succeeded and there has been no call to <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_filebuf/close\">close()</a></span> since then.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> if the associated file is open, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code> otherwise.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>This function is typically called by <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_fstream/is_open\">std::basic_fstream::is_open()</a></span>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;fstream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<spa