n> fs.<span class=\"me1\">is_open</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>direct call: true\nthrough streambuf: true\nthrough fstream: true</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_filebuf/open\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>open</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  opens a file and configures it as the associated character sequence <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_filebuf/close\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>close</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  flushes the put area buffer and closes the associated file <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"io","title":"Input/output library"},{"path":"io/basic_filebuf","title":"std::basic_filebuf"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::basic_filebuf<CharT,Traits>::is_open","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Returns true if the most recent call to open() succeeded and there has been no call to close() since then."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"true if the associated file is open, false otherwise."},{"label":"Notes","note":"This function is typically called by std::basic_fstream::is_open()."},{"label":"Exam